hts":{"FICO":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $1.1 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $1.1 billion less capital spending of $2.1 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 42.2% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $416 million.","cites":["FICO.ocf.2026","FICO.capex.2026","FICO.revenue.2026","FICO.ocf.2021","FICO.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $185 million in FY2026, 7.3% of revenue, against 8.5% in FY2021.","cites":["FICO.sbc.2026","FICO.revenue.2026","FICO.sbc.2021","FICO.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $3 billion to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["FICO.buybacks.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $657 million (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), up 27.4% from $516 million in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.revenue.2024-10-01.2025-09-30","FICO.d.revenue.2024-10-01.2025-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $2.5 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $1.3 billion and net income to $835 million.","cites":["FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.1 billion: operating cash flow of $1.1 billion less capital spending of $2.1 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FICO.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-01-27 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $36 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as -$38.9 million.","cites":["FICO.pay.peoTotal.2025","FICO.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $7.2 million in total and -$3.5 million actually paid.","cites":["FICO.pay.neoTotal.2025","FICO.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $351.82 at the end of FY2025, and $162.20 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["FICO.pay.tsr.2025","FICO.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $702 million at the end of FY2026, against $656 million a year earlier. That is 27.7% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["FICO.rpo.2026","FICO.rpo.2025","FICO.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $224 million at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $189 million a year earlier.","cites":["FICO.deferred.2026","FICO.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 3,747 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $677,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["FICO.q.employees","FICO.revenu